WEBVTT

00:07:23.189 --> 00:07:30.696
But I also cannot teach all that now,
I can’t teach you to know what respect is,

00:07:31.030 --> 00:07:33.741
what a connection 
with the land looks like,

00:07:33.782 --> 00:07:35.367
a connection with the spiritual.

00:07:35.576 --> 00:07:42.124
All I ask is ...
for your respect.

00:07:42.124 --> 00:07:45.169
Mother Earth is waiting for us 
to respect her.

00:07:45.169 --> 00:07:48.214
Mother Earth is not waiting for us 
to save her,

00:07:48.547 --> 00:07:52.009
and we as Indigenous peoples 
expect the same.